{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\"issues\":[{\"sec\":\"S05\",\"screen\":\"这一下松动，不是已经想通了\",\"source\":\"这一下松动，也像是“不是已经想通了，而是抵抗得累了”\",\"type\":2,\"severity\":\"轻微\",\"why\":\"定稿将其作为一种可能的听法，屏幕稿去掉了可能性限定，变成对这一下松动的直接判断。\"},{\"sec\":\"S06\",\"screen\":\"温柔得让人暂时放松下来\",\"source\":\"温柔得让人暂时松开戒备\",\"type\":8,\"severity\":\"轻微\",\"why\":\"原文具体指向放下心理防备，屏幕稿改成一般性的放松，弱化了戒备这一具体心理状态。\"},{\"sec\":\"S10\",\"screen\":\"而是经历许多之后仍然悬着的问题\",\"source\":\"而是历经许多之后，仍未能获得彻底答案的疲惫\",\"type\":8,\"severity\":\"轻微\",\"why\":\"定稿强调的是久未获得答案所带来的疲惫，屏幕稿改成问题仍悬而未决，改变了对迟疑状态的具体描述。\"}]}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "bd9dc18e-6e2e-46c3-bfc7-13858933cc46", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261108T090133341266Z", "elapsed_seconds": 242.797, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T09:05:36.161547+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "cf2193e07f5cb854f749c8df1f4769ca294eb330fe6e065fa43ed0a1dbf74e42", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "8